sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant F as AuthFilter
    participant PS as PaymentServlet
    participant B as BillingService
    participant D as PaymentDao
    participant DB as MySQL
    C->>F: GET /customer/pay?id=10829
    F->>F: session user has CUSTOMER role?
    F->>PS: doGet
    PS->>B: findById + ownership check
    PS-->>C: pay.jsp (amount, GST, methods)
    C->>F: POST method=UPI, detail=aarav@okaxis
    F->>PS: doPost
    PS->>B: pay(id, UPI, detail)
    B->>B: validate UPI / card format
    alt simulated decline (fail@upi / card ending 0000)
        B->>D: markFailed
        B-->>PS: PaymentException
        PS-->>C: error message, try again
    else success
        B->>D: markPaid(txnRef)
        D->>DB: UPDATE payments SET status=PAID
        B->>DB: audit_log + notification
        PS-->>C: redirect history, "Payment successful"
    end
    C->>PS: GET /customer/invoice?id=...&download=1
    PS-->>C: invoice HTML (attachment)
